# =====================================================================
# Release V058 -- referential-integrity + sentinel gate
# =====================================================================
# Post-build guard: PBI import models silently drop/fan-out rows when a fact fk doesn't resolve
# to a dim pk (a dangling key -- e.g. after a dim DROP/CREATE recreate shifts its ROW_NUMBER pk
# while a watermark-incremental fact keeps the old fk) or when a dim is missing its -1 sentinel.
# This cost a full day of "the embed shows less than Desktop" before it was found by hand.
#
#   * Audit.RI_Check_Config  -- fact fk -> target pk map (seeded from live Gold metadata;
#                               sys.* can't be queried inside a Fabric proc, so it's a table).
#   * Audit.RI_Check_Result  -- persisted per-run violations (a durable RI audit; also #temp is
#                               unusable inside the dynamic SQL in Fabric distributed mode).
#   * Audit.usp_Check_Referential_Integrity -- checks sentinels + orphans + a "mostly -1" warn,
#                               THROWS on any hard violation. Run via ETL_Run_Process so a clean
#                               run logs SUCCESS and a violation logs FAILED to the Execution log.
#
# TO WIRE IN (last step of orchestration): register this SP in Audit.Process_Config as a terminal
# job and add Audit.Process_Dependency edges from the final Gold/Agg jobs to it, so it runs LAST in
# Orchestrate_Build and a bad build cannot reach PBI. (Generate_Process_Dependencies handles the
# edges; classify it GOLD_AGG so the Gold->Agg ordering puts it after the facts.)
#
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V058__referential_integrity_gate.manifest -SkipTests
# =====================================================================

# DEPLOY the objects only -- do NOT EXEC the check here (it THROWS on any warehouse that currently
# has violations, which would fail the deploy). The check runs as a job inside orchestration.
DEPLOY  Fabric\Audit.RI_Check_Config.Table.sql
DEPLOY  Fabric\Audit.RI_Check_Config.Data.sql
DEPLOY  Fabric\Audit.usp_Check_Referential_Integrity.StoredProcedure.sql

TEST
